# Research engine — search provider selection.
# Only "demo" is implemented today (see src/lib/research/researchEngine.ts).
# Setting this to anything else without registering a provider falls back
# to "demo" with a console warning.
VITE_SEARCH_PROVIDER=demo

# Do NOT put a real search API key here with a VITE_ prefix — anything
# prefixed VITE_ is bundled into client-visible JavaScript. A real search
# provider (Bing Web Search, Google Programmable Search, SerpAPI, etc.)
# must be called from a backend/serverless function that holds its key
# server-side; the frontend should call that function, not the provider
# directly. See PROJECT_DECISIONS.md for why no live provider ships here.
